    <rnb>134</rnb>
    <tib>rdzogs pa chen po lta ba'i yang snying// sangyas thaMd kyi dgongs pa// namkha' klong yangs kyi rgyud ces bya ba</tib>
    <skt>sa ni mahA d+hi thi garba bud+ha sarba sa ma mi ti/ a kha g+ha su tra ta na ma</skt>
    <coloph>rdzogs pa chen po lta ba'i yang snying rdzogs+ho// //rgya gar gyi mkhan po bi ma' la mi tra dang/ /bod kyi lo ts+tsha ba dran pa ye shes kyis bsgyur cing gtan la phab nas/ /myang ting 'dzin bzang pos lcags sgrom nag po'i nang du/ /bram ze'i rgyud drug gdams pa dang bcas pa// bse sgrom smug por bcug nas/ /dbu ru bzong phug mo'i brag la mkhA 'gro ma rdo rje rgyan cig ma dang// badzra sa d+hu legs pa rtsal la btad nas gter du sbas pardzogso// // rdzogs pa chen po lta ba'i yang snying// sangs rgyas thams cad kyi dgongs pa//namkha' klongs yangs kyi rgyud ces bya ba/ /gser gyi dril shing can 'di/ /dang po ngo bo nyid kyi skus/ /rgyal ba kun tu bzang po la bshad/ /des rdo rje sems dpa' la bshad/ /des dga' rab rdo rje la bshad/ /des bram ze bde mchog snying po la bshad// des shri sring ha la bshad// des bi ma' mi tra la bshad/ /des tinge 'dzin bzang po la bshad// der gter du sbas/ /'broM yais bla ma'i bu/ / 'brom ye shes snying pos gton nas// des myang shes rab mchog gi sras/ /des shangs kyi ston pa lce chung pa ye shes rgyal mtshan la bshad// des bla ma gnyen chung ba la nang ba'o</coloph>
    <colophTitle/>
